- name: epy_block_0
  id: epy_block
  parameters:
    _source_code: "\"\"\"\nVideo packetizer (Embedded Python Block)\n\nPDU (UDP payload\
      \ z ffmpeg) na vstupe -> SUVISLY stream bajtov na vystupe.\nKed nie su ziadne\
      \ video data, blok posiela pseudonahodne vyplnove bajty\n(nie ramec). Prijimac\
      \ ich preskoci, lebo v nich nenajde sync word.\n\nFormat ramca (s FEC, konvolucny\
      \ kod K=7 R=1/2, polynomy 171/133):\n    SYNC(4)\n    CONV( [LEN(2)] XOR PRBS[0..1]\
      \                 | 0x00 )   -> 6 B\n    CONV( [PAYLOAD | CRC16(2)] XOR PRBS[2..]\
      \      | 0x00 )   -> 2*(LEN+3) B\n\nCRC sa pocita nad nescramblovanym payloadom.\
      \ Scrambluje sa PRED kodovanim,\ns rovnakymi indexmi ako bez FEC (LEN od 0,\
      \ payload od 2). Tail bajt 0x00 sa\nNEscrambluje, aby encoder skoncil v stave\
      \ 0. Sync slovo ostava nekodovane a\nnescramblovane.\n\nPozor: FEC znizuje uzitocnu\
      \ rychlost na polovicu (pri 300 kBd QAM16 asi\n595 kbit/s pre payload) -> bitrate\
      \ videa v ffmpeg nastav s rezervou.\n\"\"\"\n\nimport threading\nimport time\n\
      \nimport numpy as np\nfrom gnuradio import gr\nimport pmt\nimport binascii\n\
      \nSYNC_WORD = (0x1ACFFC1D).to_bytes(4, \"big\")\nMAX_LENGTH = 1800         \
      \  # musi sediet s FrameSynchronizer::max_length v prijimaci\n\n\ndef ccsds_prbs_table():\n\
      \    \"\"\"Ta ista LFSR ako ccsdsLfsr v C++: posun doprava, maska 0xA9, vystup\
      \ bit 0, MSB first.\"\"\"\n    state, taps = 0xFF, 0xA9\n    table = np.zeros(255,\
      \ dtype=np.uint8)\n    for i in range(255):\n        byte = 0\n        for _\
      \ in range(8):\n            out = state & 1\n            fb = bin(state & taps).count(\"\
      1\") & 1      # parita = XOR tapov\n            state = (state >> 1) | (fb <<\
      \ 7)\n            byte = (byte << 1) | out\n        table[i] = byte\n    return\
      \ table\n\n\nPRBS = ccsds_prbs_table()\nassert PRBS[:8].tobytes() == bytes.fromhex(\"\
      FF480EC09A0D70BC\"), \"zla PRBS tabulka\"\n\n\ndef scramble(data, offset):\n\
      \    \"\"\"XOR s PRBS od indexu offset (perioda 255 B).\"\"\"\n    buf = np.frombuffer(data,\
      \ dtype=np.uint8)\n    return (buf ^ PRBS[(offset + np.arange(len(buf))) % 255]).tobytes()\n\
      \n\n# ------------------------------------------------------- konvolucny encoder\n\
      # Rovnaky ako K7Encoder v C++: stav = poslednych 6 bitov (najnovsi na bite 0),\n\
      # polynomy otocene (171 -> 0x4F, 133 -> 0x6D), na kazdy bit vyjde par (G1, G2).\n\
      G1 = 0x4F\nG2 = 0x6D\n\n\ndef _parity(x):\n    return bin(x).count(\"1\") &\
      \ 1\n\n\ndef conv_byte_table():\n    \"\"\"Pre kazdy (stav, vstupny bajt) predpocita\
      \ 16 kodovanych bitov a novy stav.\n    Encoder potom robi jeden lookup na bajt\
      \ namiesto 8 krokov v Pythone.\"\"\"\n    out_tab = [[0] * 256 for _ in range(64)]\n\
      \    next_tab = [[0] * 256 for _ in range(64)]\n    for s0 in range(64):\n \
      \       for byte in range(256):\n            s, coded = s0, 0\n            for\
      \ i in range(7, -1, -1):              # MSB first\n                reg = (s\
      \ << 1) | ((byte >> i) & 1)\n                coded = (coded << 2) | (_parity(reg\
      \ & G1) << 1) | _parity(reg & G2)\n                s = reg & 0x3F\n        \
      \    out_tab[s0][byte] = coded\n            next_tab[s0][byte] = s\n    return\
      \ out_tab, next_tab\n\n\nCONV_OUT, CONV_NEXT = conv_byte_table()\n\n\ndef conv_encode(data):\n\
      \    \"\"\"Bajty -> kodovane bajty (2x dlhsie). Encoder zacina v stave 0.\n\
      \    Na ukoncenie bloku musi byt posledny vstupny bajt 0x00.\"\"\"\n    out\
      \ = bytearray(2 * len(data))\n    s = 0\n    for i, byte in enumerate(data):\n\
      \        coded = CONV_OUT[s][byte]\n        out[2 * i] = coded >> 8\n      \
      \  out[2 * i + 1] = coded & 0xFF\n        s = CONV_NEXT[s][byte]\n    return\
      \ bytes(out)\n\n\n# impulzna odozva: 1 a nuly -> 11 10 11 11 00 01 11 00 ...\n\
      assert conv_encode(b\"\\x80\\x00\")[:2] == bytes([0b11101111, 0b00011100]),\
      \ \"zly konvolucny encoder\"\n\n\ndef build_frame(data):\n    \"\"\"Cely ramec\
      \ s FEC pre jeden payload.\"\"\"\n    crc = binascii.crc_hqx(data, 0xFFFF) \
      \       # CRC-16/CCITT-FALSE, nad cistymi datami\n    header = scramble(len(data).to_bytes(2,\
      \ \"big\"), 0) + b\"\\x00\"\n    body = scramble(data + crc.to_bytes(2, \"big\"\
      ), 2) + b\"\\x00\"\n    return SYNC_WORD + conv_encode(header) + conv_encode(body)\n\
      \n\nclass blk(gr.sync_block):\n    \"\"\"Video packetizer: msg_in (PDU) -> continuous\
      \ uint8 stream (packed bytes)\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, max_backlog=65536,\
      \ fill_chunk=256, stats_period=2.0):\n        gr.sync_block.__init__(\n    \
      \        self,\n            name='Video packetizer',\n            in_sig=None,\
      \            # ziadny stream vstup -> work() riadi len miesto vo vystupe\n \
      \           out_sig=[np.uint8]      # packed bajty pre Constellation Modulator\n\
      \        )\n\n        self.message_port_register_in(pmt.intern('msg_in'))\n\
      \        self.set_msg_handler(pmt.intern('msg_in'), self.create_frame)\n\n \
      \       self.max_backlog = int(max_backlog)     # max bajtov cakajucich vo fronte\n\
      \        self.fill_chunk = int(fill_chunk)       # max vyplne na jedno volanie\
      \ work()\n        self.stats_period = float(stats_period)\n\n        self._pending\
      \ = bytearray()             # fronta hotovych ramcov\n        self._lock = threading.Lock()\n\
      \n        # Predgenerovana pseudonahodna vypln, cita sa cyklicky\n        rng\
      \ = np.random.default_rng(0x1ACF)\n        self._filler = rng.integers(0, 256,\
      \ 1 << 16, dtype=np.uint8)\n        self._fill_pos = 0\n\n        # Statistiky\n\
      \        self._frames = 0\n        self._dropped = 0\n        self._too_long\
      \ = 0\n        self._payload_bytes = 0\n        self._data_bytes = 0\n     \
      \   self._fill_bytes = 0\n        self._max_seen_backlog = 0\n        self._last_stats\
      \ = time.monotonic()\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\
      \ vstup\n    def create_frame(self, msg):\n        data = np.asarray(pmt.u8vector_elements(pmt.cdr(msg)),\
      \ dtype=np.uint8).tobytes()\n        if not data:\n            return\n\n  \
      \      # Prijimac zahodi ramce s LEN > MAX_LENGTH, nema zmysel ich vysielat\n\
      \        if len(data) > MAX_LENGTH:\n            with self._lock:\n        \
      \        self._too_long += 1\n            return\n\n        frame = build_frame(data)\n\
      \n        with self._lock:\n            # Ochrana pred neobmedzenym rastom latencie:\
      \ radsej zahodit cely ramec\n            if len(self._pending) + len(frame)\
      \ > self.max_backlog:\n                self._dropped += 1\n                return\n\
      \            self._pending += frame\n            self._frames += 1\n       \
      \     self._payload_bytes += len(data)\n            self._max_seen_backlog =\
      \ max(self._max_seen_backlog, len(self._pending))\n\n    # -----------------------------------------------------------------\
      \ vystup\n    def work(self, input_items, output_items):\n        out = output_items[0]\n\
      \        n = len(out)\n\n        with self._lock:\n            k = min(n, len(self._pending))\n\
      \            if k:\n                # slice bytearray vytvori kopiu, takze del\
      \ nizsie je bezpecny\n                out[:k] = np.frombuffer(self._pending[:k],\
      \ dtype=np.uint8)\n                del self._pending[:k]\n                self._data_bytes\
      \ += k\n                self._maybe_print_stats()\n                return k\n\
      \n        # Fronta je prazdna -> vypln (nikdy nie uprostred ramca)\n       \
      \ k = min(n, self.fill_chunk)\n        idx = (self._fill_pos + np.arange(k))\
      \ % len(self._filler)\n        out[:k] = self._filler[idx]\n        self._fill_pos\
      \ = (self._fill_pos + k) % len(self._filler)\n        self._fill_bytes += k\n\
      \        with self._lock:\n            self._maybe_print_stats()\n        return\
      \ k\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------- diagnostika\n\
      \    def _maybe_print_stats(self):\n        now = time.monotonic()\n       \
      \ dt = now - self._last_stats\n        if self.stats_period <= 0 or dt < self.stats_period:\n\
      \            return\n        total = self._data_bytes + self._fill_bytes\n \
      \       load = 100.0 * self._data_bytes / total if total else 0.0\n        print(f\"\
      [packetizer] {self._frames / dt:6.1f} frames/s  \"\n              f\"video {8\
      \ * self._payload_bytes / dt / 1e3:7.1f} kbit/s  \"\n              f\"kodovane\
      \ {8 * self._data_bytes / dt / 1e3:7.1f} kbit/s  \"\n              f\"vytazenie\
      \ {load:5.1f} %  \"\n              f\"backlog {len(self._pending)} B (max {self._max_seen_backlog}\
      \ B)  \"\n              f\"zahodene {self._dropped}  prilis dlhe {self._too_long}\"\
      , flush=True)\n        self._frames = self._payload_bytes = self._data_bytes\
      \ = self._fill_bytes = 0\n        self._max_seen_backlog = len(self._pending)\n\
      \        self._dropped = 0\n        self._too_long = 0\n        self._last_stats\
      \ = now\n"
    affinity: ''
    alias: ''
    comment: ''
    fill_chunk: '256'
    max_backlog: '16_000'
    maxoutbuf: '0'
    minoutbuf: '0'
    stats_period: '2'
  states:
    _io_cache: '(''Video packetizer'', ''blk'', [(''max_backlog'', ''65536''), (''fill_chunk'',
      ''256''), (''stats_period'', ''2.0'')], [(''msg_in'', ''message'', 1)], [(''0'',
      ''byte'', 1)], ''Video packetizer: msg_in (PDU) -> continuous uint8 stream (packed
      bytes)'', [''fill_chunk'', ''max_backlog'', ''stats_period''])'
    bus_sink: false
    bus_source: false
    bus_structure: null
    coordinate: [368, 252.0]
    rotation: 0
    state: enabled
